# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# 🏥 NURSING HOME REPORTING SYSTEM — Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─── Institution Details ──────────────────────────────────
NURSING_HOME_NAME=בית האבות
NURSING_HOME_MANAGER=מנהל התפעול
OWNER_PHONE=972501234567

# ─── Anthropic Claude API (REQUIRED for AI analysis) ─────
# https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# ─── Microsoft OneDrive (REQUIRED for document scanning) ─
# Register app at: https://portal.azure.com → Azure Active Directory → App registrations
# Required permissions: Files.Read.All, Files.ReadWrite.All (Delegated)
MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID=your_azure_app_client_id
MICROSOFT_TENANT_ID=common

# OneDrive folders to scan (JSON array or comma-separated)
# Leave empty to scan entire drive
ONEDRIVE_SCAN_FOLDERS=["מסמכים", "תקציב", "בטיחות", "פרויקטים", "אחזקה", "גינון"]

# ─── Report Delivery ──────────────────────────────────────
# Email address to receive generated reports
REPORT_EMAIL=manager@nursing-home.co.il

# Gmail — for sending report emails (optional)
# Gmail → Settings → Security → 2-Step Verification → App Passwords
EMAIL_ADDRESS=your@gmail.com
EMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
EMAIL_FROM_NAME=מערכת הדיווח

# ─── WhatsApp Cloud API ───────────────────────────────────
# https://developers.facebook.com/apps/
WHATSAPP_TOKEN=your_whatsapp_access_token_here
WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=your_phone_number_id_here
VERIFY_TOKEN=my_secret_verify_token

# ─── Groq (for WhatsApp chat) ─────────────────────────────
# https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here

# ─── ngrok (for local development) ───────────────────────
# https://dashboard.ngrok.com/get-started/your-authtoken
NGROK_AUTHTOKEN=your_ngrok_authtoken_here

# ─── OpenAI (for voice transcription) ────────────────────
# https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# ─── Google Calendar (optional) ──────────────────────────
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_google_client_secret

# ─── Meta (for auto webhook registration) ────────────────
# META_APP_ID=your_meta_app_id
# META_APP_SECRET=your_meta_app_secret

# ─── Server ───────────────────────────────────────────────
PORT=3000
